  "question": {
    "text": "A pole is situated at the centre of a regular hexagonal park. The angle of elevation of the top of the vertical pole when observed from each vertex of the hexagon is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math> If the area of the circle circumscribing the hexagon is&nbsp;<math><mn>27</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then the height of the tower is",
    "image": null
  },
