      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>π</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RyQc4",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
